The DOMContentLoaded event is not necessary for modules to execute correctly. Modules are executed before DOMContentLoaded because they are executed asynchronously and can run before the DOM is fully loaded. However, modules do not rely on DOMContentLoaded to access nodes correctly because they are designed to work with the DOM as it becomes available, not when it is fully loaded.

